content:
The recent-payment courtesy on the late fee of a ClearPath Managed IT Services invoice counts the payments posted on the agreement:
- one or more in the last 1 month take 25.0 percent off;
- none then but one or more in the last 3 months take 10.0 percent off;
- none in that window takes nothing off.

A whole month between two dates is counted only once the later date reaches the same day of the month as the earlier one, and a month window of N months ending today takes the entries dated fewer than N whole months before today. Payments are the payment entries on the agreement's billing ledger, counted by posting date.

**Hypothetical cases, assessment on 2025-08-01.** A payment posted 2025-07-15: within the last month, 25.0 percent off. Latest payment posted 2025-07-01: one whole month old, outside the 1-month window but inside the 3-month window, 10.0 percent off. Latest payment posted 2025-05-01: three whole months old, nothing off.
